OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order parade dispute
OL,4,Acontinues after main players hold talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main parties involved in a parading
OL,7,Fdispute in Northern Ireland are still
OL,8,Fin a stalemate, as talks to resolve the
OL,9,Fissue continue.
OL,11,FMembers of the Orange Order are still
OL,12,Fwaiting to begin their permitted
OL,13,Fparade, which was due to take place on
OL,14,FSunday morning, and walk down the
OL,15,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,16,FPortadown.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
